  "description": {
    "ja": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (ja): ホナガイヌビユ",
      "source_url": "https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%83%9B%E3%83%8A%E3%82%AC%E3%82%A4%E3%83%8C%E3%83%93%E3%83%A6",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 109592034,
      "text": "ホナガイヌビユ は、ヒユ科ヒユ属の1年草。道端や畑などに生える雑草。アオビユ（青莧）ともいう。"
    },
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (en): Amaranthus viridis",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Amaranthus_viridis",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 1375504525,
      "text": "Amaranthus viridis is a cosmopolitan species in the botanical family Amaranthaceae and is commonly known as slender amaranth or green amaranth. It is native to the tropics of the Americas, specifically South America, Central America, and the Caribbean."
    },
    "es": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (es): Amaranthus viridis",
      "source_url": "https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Amaranthus_viridis",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 173021731,
      "text": "Amaranthus viridis L. es una especie herbácea cosmopolita perteneciente a la familia Amaranthaceae. Se la conoce con varios nombres en toda América, como: \"citaco\", \"chiori pequeño\", \"bledo chino\", \"chichimeca\", \"calabú\", \"amaranto verde\", \"bleo\", \"moco pavo\", entre otros."
    },
    "fr": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (fr): Amaranthus viridis",
      "source_url": "https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Amaranthus_viridis",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 207909391,
      "text": "Amaranthus viridis, l'amarante verte, est une espèce de plantes dicotylédones de la famille des Amaranthaceae, originaire des régions tropicales."
    },
    "pt": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (pt): Caruru",
      "source_url": "https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Caruru",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 71122884,
      "text": "Caruru é a designação comum a certas plantas do gênero Amaranthus, da família das amarantáceas, algumas de folhas comestíveis, bastante utilizada em culinária. A maioria delas é invasora de plantações. É também conhecida como bredo em Pernambuco e na Bahia, onde é utilizado na culinária local, reservando-se o termo \"caruru\" a um prato que, geralmente, não leva esta planta nos seus ingredientes."
    },
    "id": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (id): Bayam raja",
      "source_url": "https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bayam_raja",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 28497944,
      "text": "Amaranthus viridis adalah spesies kosmopolitan dalam keluarga botani Amaranthaceae dan umumnya dikenal sebagai bayam kecil atau bayam raja."
    }
  },
